<p>Over the next 4 turns you'll fire up to 4 arrows at this target from this location, each dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">85%, 100%, 111%, 121%, 130%</acronym> weapon damage to the target. </p><p>These shots do not consume ammo.</p>